  "description_text": "Welcome to this beautifully updated brick home in the heart of Logan Square, offering 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and the perfect blend of classic Chicago charm and modern convenience! Step inside to discover hardwood floors, a spacious kitchen featuring cherry cabinetry, granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and thoughtful upgrades including a Moen smart faucet, newer GE refrigerator, and Bosch dishwasher. The second level features a generously sized primary bedroom with access to a private outdoor deck, creating the perfect retreat. Major renovations included updated electrical, plumbing, HVAC, roof, windows, siding, and outdoor decks, providing peace of mind for years to come. Outside, enjoy a beautifully improved backyard with a cedar privacy fence, patio, and partially covered outdoor entertaining space. A standout feature is the custom-built 2.5-car garage completed in 2021, featuring impressive 9-foot ceilings, insulated walls, finished interior, and a smart garage door opener. Additional improvements include a newer water heater and smart ceiling fans. Conveniently located near I-90/94, Target, entertainment, shopping, and Logan Square's vibrant dining and nightlife scene. Enjoy the best of city living with neighborhood charm, modern upgrades, and exceptional indoor and outdoor space. A fantastic opportunity to own a move-in-ready home in one of Chicago's most sought-after neighborhoods!",
